[{"title":"精进阁","author":"释德葵","text":"五月六月火云蒸，家家纳凉前后庭。\n楼头四鼓五鼓急，阁上犹闻人诵经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21540,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题海慧寺画水壁","author":"释德葵","text":"君不见昔人十日画一水，摩挲洼窿随手起。\n若非胸次吞江湖，安得波澜来笔底。\n我来萧寺观奇踪，壁间隐隐腾蛟龙。\n初疑乘风驭弱水，恍然坐我蓬莱宫。\n又疑去年八月秋水溢，阴风袭人廊庑湿。\n谁知画者巧通神，董羽至今羞死笔。\n此水不是画，一水一水势相及。\n对此融神坐终日，后人虽画画不出。\n何如倒却毗陵华严壁，海慧北廊推第一。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21541,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新笋","author":"释德辉","text":"竹笋初生牛犊角，蕨芽新长小儿拳。\n旋挑野菜炊香饭，便是江南二月天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21542,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞世偈","author":"释德辉","text":"一生无利亦无名，圆顶方袍自在行。\n道念只从心上起，禅机俱向舌根生。\n百千万劫假非假，六十三年真不真。\n今向无名丛内去，不遗一物在南屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21543,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂","author":"释德韶","text":"暂下高峰已显扬，般若圜通遍十方。\n人天浩浩无差别，法界纵横处处彰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21544,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释德韶","text":"通玄峰顶，不是人门。\n心外无法，满目青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21545,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自题月轩","author":"释德聪","text":"轩前辘轳转冰盘，轩里诗成彻骨寒。\n多少人来看明月，谁知倒被月明看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21546,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂","author":"释德遵","text":"索火之机实快哉，藏锋妙用少人猜。\n要会我师亲的旨，红炉火尽不添柴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21547,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人至收书知得心座元安乐蒙惠数珠水晶者金重十二钱一收讫山偈奉赠","author":"释慧开","text":"百八摩尼颗颗圆，辽天鼻孔一齐穿。\n恒河砂数佛菩萨，每日呼来跳一圈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21548,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大医禅师赞","author":"释慧开","text":"坚辞凤阙紫泥诏，玷辱宗风个古锥。\n坐断双峰无寸草，爱松留得碍人枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21549,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大满禅师赞","author":"释慧开","text":"再出头来满面尘，那堪鼓舌与摇唇。\n松枯石烂凭谁委，累及痴呆蹈碓人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21550,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六年举无字一日闻斋鼓有省","author":"释慧开","text":"青天白日一声雷，大地群生眼豁开。\n万象森罗齐稽首，须弥?跳舞三台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21551,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无际","author":"释慧开","text":"祖翁田地没凭据，争许时人取次量。\n但见寥寥成一片，不知何处是封疆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21552,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无量寿佛赞","author":"释慧开","text":"乾屎橛兮麻三斤，当阳拈出少知音。\n时人不识自家佛，却向丹青画处寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21553,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日本觉心禅人远来炷香请益求诗迅笔赠之","author":"释慧开","text":"心即是佛佛即心，心佛元同亘古今。\n觉悟古今心是佛，不须向外别追寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21554,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"头袖","author":"释慧开","text":"四海英灵俱夺下，铜头铁额总兜来。\n莫怪无门施毒手，揭翻脑盖顶门开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21555,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白云法师赞","author":"释慧开","text":"伟哉大法师，逢难转坚牢。\n不因登绝顶，争见白云高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21556,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"在南高峰石室中出定作","author":"释慧开","text":"静处乾坤窄，闲居日月忙。\n虚空即妙体，独露法中王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21557,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛头圆相赞","author":"释慧开","text":"生怕云门打杀伊，韬光晦迹许多时。\n而今再出头来也，天上人间更有谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21558,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛母周氏赞","author":"释慧开","text":"室女生儿真祸胎，丛林孰不起疑猜。\n转身术子能灵验，再出头来满面埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21559,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴尚书尊堂死以偈问用韵以复","author":"释慧开","text":"身分水月遍三千，月落何曾离得天。\n此是夫人行履处，摩耶相对共谈禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21560,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"帐子","author":"释慧开","text":"才得当阳一线通，全彰大用显家风。\n直饶鼻孔辽天汉，未免从头被罩笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21561,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孟少保绘师握拳缺指相请赞","author":"释慧开","text":"为人手段十分粗，拳下搜寻一个无。\n咄这村僧难凑泊，释迦弥勒是他奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21562,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孟少保戎装相赞","author":"释慧开","text":"英雄盖世上将军，洞寇闻风丧胆魂。\n寸刃不施机莫测，看渠谈笑定乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21563,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"总轴罗汉","author":"释慧开","text":"洞寇都卢十八头，千妖百怪逞风流。\n人间天上称尊汉，总被无门一握收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21564,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"政黄牛赞","author":"释慧开","text":"资福从来不识羞，橘皮熟炙逞风流。\n倚筇懒赴贤侯命，又却骑牛更觅牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21565,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"圆觉会","author":"释慧开","text":"十二呆郎欲决疑，瞿昙嚼饭喂婴儿。\n若教知有衲僧事，终不人前鼓口皮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21566,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"请无门首座立僧山偈奉谢","author":"释宗寿","text":"瑞岩近日有无门，掇向绳床判古今。\n凡圣路头俱截断，几多蟠蛰起雷音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21567,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其四十二","author":"释慧开","text":"出得出不得，渠侬得自由。\n神头并鬼面，败阙当风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21568,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其四十","author":"释慧开","text":"飏下笊篱并木杓，当阳一突绝周遮。\n百丈重关拦不住，脚尖趯出佛如麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21569,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其二十七","author":"释慧开","text":"叮咛损君德，无言真有功。\n任从沧海变，终不为君通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21570,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其二十三","author":"释慧开","text":"描不成兮画不就，赞不及兮休生受。\n本来面目没处藏，世界坏时渠不朽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21571,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其十八","author":"释慧开","text":"突出麻三斤，言亲意更亲。\n来说是非者，便是是非人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21572,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其十七","author":"释慧开","text":"铁枷无孔要人担，累及儿孙不等闲。\n欲得撑门并拄户，更须赤脚上刀山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21573,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其十二","author":"释慧开","text":"学道之人不识真，只为从前认识神。\n无量劫来生死本，痴人唤作本来人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21574,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四十八首 其九","author":"释慧开","text":"了身何似了心休，了得心兮身不愁。\n若也身心俱了了，神仙何必更封侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21575,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二首 其二","author":"释慧开","text":"欲把生蛇化活龙，先将毒药灌喉咙。\n常教满腹如针刺，抛向洪波大浪中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21576,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二首 其一","author":"释慧开","text":"黄龙结制不寻常，只用阎罗断命方。\n生铁一团红咽下，死中再活获清凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21577,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其八","author":"释慧开","text":"静中消息闹中观，闹中消息静中看。\n静闹掀翻行正令，倚天长剑逼人寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21578,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其四十四","author":"释慧开","text":"三月清明节禁烟，桃华带雨倍鲜妍。\n皆言当日灵云悟，笑破禅和口半边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21579,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其二十一","author":"释慧开","text":"状元笔下鼓风雷，未放游鳞久曝腮。\n激起砚池些子水，洗光幕阜翠崔嵬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21580,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其二十八","author":"释慧开","text":"独弄单提向上机，机前荐得早迟疑。\n相逢觌面凭谁委，父子虽亲各不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21581,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其十五","author":"释慧开","text":"眼如鼻孔口如槌，业识忙忙唤不回。\n南浦西山耕未遍，披毛戴角又重来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21582,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其六","author":"释慧开","text":"茅庵草舍住山深，无奈檀那错访寻。\n了却先师未了底，恶声从此满丛林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21583,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其二十五","author":"释慧开","text":"湘南潭北影团团，面面檐楹风雨寒。\n突出虚空无缝罅，从教千古与人看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21584,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其六十八","author":"释慧开","text":"衲僧今日路头通，拄杖生云兴已浓。\n要探江湖深与浅，前途更有妙高峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21585,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其三十六","author":"释慧开","text":"瞿昙遗下葛藤窠，翻覆看来脱处多。\n不是儿孙重检点，古今争得绝誵讹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21586,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其三十一","author":"释慧开","text":"参禅莫滞静工夫，闹处相逢在半途。\n静闹两关俱不涉，赵州东壁挂葫芦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21587,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其八十三","author":"释慧开","text":"出洞昂头角，回山露尾巴。\n恩承饶舌力，累我受波查。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21588,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其八十五","author":"释慧开","text":"名高不用镌顽石，路上行人口是碑。\n大宋正传天子令，直教诸国竖降旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21589,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其十七","author":"释慧开","text":"地黑天昏见得亲，肯随光影弄精魂。\n老僧拳下死中活，佛与众生一口吞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21590,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其六十五","author":"释慧开","text":"昨日去年去，今朝今岁来。\n去年去不去，今岁来不来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21591,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其六十","author":"释慧开","text":"图列千山开画嶂，带围一水绕蓬瀛。\n脚头未举已先入，不用门前弹指声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21592,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其七十","author":"释慧开","text":"燕国当年植福田，身如水月印三千。\n渠无生死归何处，春早梅华放晓烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21593,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其八十一","author":"释慧开","text":"山前麦熟已如云，觌面当机为指陈。\n蓦地一番梅雨过，青山洗出画图新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21594,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其八十六","author":"释慧开","text":"普贤行愿等三千，正是清明首夏天。\n要见大人真境界，月明常照御楼前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21595,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂八十七首 其三十五","author":"释慧开","text":"侬家没兴眼无筋，错中南方蛊毒深。\n一掬肝肠俱裂破，年年此日痛伤心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21596,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"维摩居士赞","author":"释慧开","text":"毗耶病虎实难亲，触著渠侬便丧身。\n非但文殊遭毒口，吞尽灵山一会人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21597,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题壁间水波观音","author":"释慧开","text":"曹源正派喜流传，涓滴浑无浪拍天。\n任是大悲千手眼，探渠深浅待驴年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21598,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"懒牛","author":"释慧开","text":"不经南陌与西阡，犁杷年来怕上肩。\n弃却栏中肥嫩草，绿杨堤畔饱风烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21599,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"镜智禅师赞","author":"释慧开","text":"弥天罪犯无门忏，红烂通身世莫医。\n已是四棱俱塌地，尽教后代乱针锥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21600,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢佛眼师号","author":"释慧开","text":"皇恩颁自九重城，雨露才沾草木荣。\n佛祖门庭增瑞气，四海欢呼万岁声。\n忠心护国成勋业，君父开臣佛眼睛。\n寿山福海恩难报，永日寥寥贺太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21601,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又道装相赞","author":"释慧开","text":"灵山付嘱人，示现威棱身。\n在欲而无欲，居尘不染尘。\n等闲伸出擎天手，拨转如来正法轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21602,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大祖禅师赞","author":"释慧开","text":"三拜起来依位立，普天匝地黑漫漫。\n可怜只臂空轮却，千古令人作笑端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21603,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大鉴禅师赞","author":"释慧开","text":"菩提无树镜非台，臭口分明鬼擘开。\n幸是卖柴无事獠，刚然惹得一身灾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21604,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"志公和尚赞","author":"释慧开","text":"杖头络索闲家具，应谶三朝经几秋。\n生向鹰窠来处异，面皮擘破十三头。\n叻，因渠达磨枝条布，恼乱春风卒未休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21605,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日本觉心长老请赞","author":"释慧开","text":"用迷子诀，飞红炉雪。\n一喝当锋，崖崩石裂。\n化生蛇作活龙，点黄金为生铁。\n去缚解粘，抽钉拔楔。\n更将佛祖不传机，此界他方俱漏泄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21606,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月泉赵寺丞寿像赞","author":"释慧开","text":"身为皇族，名著南宫。\n孔孟屋里，做模打样。\n释老室内，谈玄说空。\n似个般伎俩，半钱不直，又说甚道理三教俱通。\n从前学解掀翻尽，却于无处立宗风。\n天龙更为重饶舌，熨斗煎茶铫不同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21607,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石牛","author":"释慧开","text":"须弥为骨露纤躯，头角峥嵘塞太虚。\n大地耕翻无寸土，牧童鞭索岂能拘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21608,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴履斋以脚蹈日影索偈","author":"释慧开","text":"圆陀陀，光烁烁。\n明眼人，蹈不著。\n蹈得著，更买草鞋去行脚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21609,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"护国嗣本长老请赞","author":"释慧开","text":"法身无相，徒更形容。\n本来面目，逼塞虚空。\n浩荡十方能变化，行看九万自抟风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21610,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"护国嗣源长老请赞","author":"释慧开","text":"龙床角畔，建古招提。\n一滴浑无，嗣曹源正派。\n寸丝不挂，付夜半伽梨。\n成家喜见破家儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21611,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"针筒","author":"释慧开","text":"函盖乾坤气量周，铜睛铁眼一齐取。\n几多利脑尖锋者，到此如何敢出头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21612,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孟无庵与师同轴请赞","author":"释慧开","text":"居士身，比丘相。\n跷跷踦踦，牢牢攘攘。\n蓦然觌面相逢，直是无门可向。\n一拳一喝，双收双放。\n无庵居士眼无筋，识得这般村和尚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21613,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庞居士赞","author":"释慧开","text":"平欺马祖，下视诸方。\n生涯荡却，今古无双。\n不与万法为侣，一口吸尽西江。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21614,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"法孙天龙长老思贤请赞","author":"释慧开","text":"咄这村僧，百拙千丑。\n用处颟顸，举止磔斗。\n秉恶毒钳锤，碎情尘窠臼。\n佛祖饮气吞声，魔外望风拱手。\n有时汉语胡言，总当谈玄说妙。\n有时把拍板门槌，唱云门曲合胡笳调。\n有时指圆觉场作牛栏，有时唤普光殿为马厩。\n如斯孟浪为人，钝置月林之后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21615,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]